  "details": "Hello VRChat GUI Team,\n\nThe new Live Now tab is a major improvement over the previous iteration, and I think it's fantastic. But there is one major issue with the creator-generated images it presents.\n\nAll images are squished or stretched. \n\nImages in the main view are squished horizontally. And images in the details view are stretched horizontally. \n\nPlease make sure that user created art is presented as the user intended. A perfect circle should render as a perfect circle in the Live Now tab.\n\nThanks!",
